 "posts": {
  "freestone-2012-08-18": {
   "track": "freestone",
   "event_name": "AllStar Amateurs",
   "start": "2012-08-18T17:00",
   "end": "2012-08-18T23:00",
   "source_url": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/allstar-amateurs-rained-out/",
   "post": {
    "date": "2012-08-18T06:51:31",
    "link": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/allstar-amateurs-rained-out/",
    "title": {
     "rendered": "AllStar Amateurs Rained Out"
    },
    "content": {
     "rendered": "<p>August 18, 2012 (Wortham, Texas) &#8211; Tonight&#8217;s 4th Annual AllStar Amateurs has been rained out and rescheduled for Sunday, December 2nd. The event will be on the Pro National track.</p>\n<p>Thanks for all our contingency sponsors including: <a href=\"http://www.acerbis.com/\">Acerbis</a>, <a href=\"http://www.chilis.com/\">Chili’s</a>, <a href=\"http://www.clifbar.com/\">Clif Bar</a>, <a href=\"http://www.engineice.com/\">Engine Ice</a>, <a href=\"http://www.fmfracing.com/\">FMF</a>,<a href=\"http://www.lucasoil.com/\">Lucas Oil</a>, <a href=\"http://www.motionpro.com/\">Motion Pro</a>, <a href=\"http://www.moto-masterusa.com/\">Moto Masters</a>, <a href=\"http://www.pmpsprockets.com/\">PMP Sprockets</a>, <a href=\"http://www.proclean1000.com/\">Pro Clean 1000</a>, <a href=\"http://www.protaper.com/\">Pro Taper</a>, <a href=\"http://www.redbullusa.com/\">Red Bull Energy Drink</a>, <a href=\"http://www.redbullusa.com/cs/Satellite/en_US/Red-Bulletin-Magazine/001243140905767\">Red Bulletin</a>, <a href=\"http://www.renthal.com/\">Renthal</a>, <a href=\"http://scott-sports.com/\">Scott USA</a>, <a href=\"http://www.speedgraffix.com/\">Speed Graffix</a>, <a href=\"http://www.suspensiondynamics.com/\">Suspension Dynamics</a>, <a href=\"http://www.thormx.com/\">THOR</a>, <a href=\"http://www.twinair.com/usa/\">Twin Air</a>, <a href=\"http://www.vpracingfuels.com/\">VP Fuels</a>, and <a href=\"http://www.xtremekolorsonline.com/\">Xtreme Kolors</a>.</p>\n<p>We will have more announcements coming in regard to the AllStar Amateurs so stay tuned here.  If you have not signed up for our Email Notifier, do it today.  We do not spam &#8230;&#8230; promise!!  Just go to Contact &#8211; Join Email List.</p>\n"
    }
   }
  },
  "freestone-2013-11-02": {
   "track": "freestone",
   "event_name": "AMA AllStar Amateurs",
   "start": "2013-11-02T08:00",
   "end": "2013-11-02T17:00",
   "source_url": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/allstar-amateurs-cancelled/",
   "post": {
    "date": "2013-11-01T09:58:25",
    "link": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/allstar-amateurs-cancelled/",
    "title": {
     "rendered": "AllStar Amateurs Cancelled"
    },
    "content": {
     "rendered": "<p>November 1, 2013 (Wortham, Texas) &#8211; Sorry to say but with over 8 inches of rain at Freestone and only 24 hours until the gates would open at the Miller Ranch, there is not enough time to recover from the well-needed rain fall.  The AMA AllStar Amateurs is cancelled and we will update with further information later.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"> <a href=\"http://67.205.147.236/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001.jpg\"><img data-attachment-id=\"8966\" data-permalink=\"https://freestonemx.com/racing/events-2/allstar-amateurs/attachment/allstar-amateurs-800/\" data-orig-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"800,790\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"AllStar Amateurs\" data-image-description=\"\" data-medium-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001-300x296.jpg\" data-large-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001.jpg\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-8966\" alt=\"AllStar Amateurs\" src=\"http://67.205.147.236/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001-300x296.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"296\" srcset=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001-300x296.jpg 300w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001-100x100.jpg 100w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001-600x593.jpg 600w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/AllStar-Amateurs-8001.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n"
    }
   }
  },
  "freestone-2016-08-13": {
   "track": "freestone",
   "event_name": "AMA Main Event Series Round 4",
   "start": "2016-08-13T08:00",
   "end": "2016-08-13T18:00",
   "source_url": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/alert-main-event-series-cancelled/",
   "post": {
    "date": "2016-08-13T07:07:49",
    "link": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/alert-main-event-series-cancelled/",
    "title": {
     "rendered": "ALERT: Main Event Series Cancelled"
    },
    "content": {
     "rendered": "<p>August 13, 2016 (Wortham, Texas) &#8211; You would expect 103 degrees and humidity to match but not April showers in August.  With an 80% chance of rain, sadly Round 4 of the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a href=\"http://67.205.147.236/racing/events-2/main-event-series/\">AMA Main Event Series</a></strong></span> is cancelled.  There is no use is asking the riders of Houston to make the trip to Freestone with that type of forecast.</p>\n<p>No rescheduled date will be made.  The next round is at Freedom MX Park in Highlands next weekend, August 20th.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://67.205.147.236/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-12932\"><img data-attachment-id=\"12932\" data-permalink=\"https://freestonemx.com/?attachment_id=12932\" data-orig-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"800,600\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Featured-Image-MES-2016\" data-image-description=\"\" data-medium-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016-300x225.jpg\" data-large-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-12932 aligncenter\" src=\"http://67.205.147.236/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016.jpg\" alt=\"Featured-Image-MES-2016\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016.jpg 800w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016-600x450.jpg 600w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016-300x225.jpg 300w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Featured-Image-MES-2016-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
    }
