  "freestone-2023-06-10": {
   "track": "freestone",
   "event_name": "Night Flight Series Round 4",
   "start": "2023-06-10T17:00",
   "end": "2023-06-10T23:00",
   "source_url": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/rnd-4-night-flight-canceled-due-to-possible-hail-and-tornados/",
   "post": {
    "date": "2023-06-10T08:16:35",
    "link": "https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/rnd-4-night-flight-canceled-due-to-possible-hail-and-tornados/",
    "title": {
     "rendered": "Rnd 4 Night Flight Canceled Due To Possible Hail And Tornados"
    },
    "content": {
     "rendered": "\n<p>Round 4 of the Night Flight Series at Freestone is canceled due to possible hail and tornados in the weather forecast. We put our customers safety first and we don’t want to take any chances. The amount of precipitation has gone up and down in the last few days, but tornados and hail weren’t in the forecast. <br></p>\n\n\n\n<p>We will run double points next round at Freestone July 8th. <br></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"26475\" data-permalink=\"https://freestonemx.com/?attachment_id=26475\" data-orig-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23-.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1700,2160\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"_Night Flight SS Dates Schedule 2023 revised 4-3-23\" data-image-description=\"\" data-medium-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23--236x300.jpg\" data-large-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23--806x1024.jpg\" src=\"http://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23--806x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-26475\" srcset=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23--806x1024.jpg 806w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23--236x300.jpg 236w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Night-Flight-SS-Dates-Schedule-2023-revised-4-3-23--768x976.