    "content": {
     "rendered": "\n<p>Rnd 2 of The 25th Annual FMF Texas Night Series at Murphy&#8217;s Mx is canceled due to the weather. Reschedule date TBA.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-attachment-id=\"29731\" data-permalink=\"https://freestonemx.com/latest-news/rnd-2-fmf-texas-night-series-canceled/attachment/flyer-tns-2024-canceled/\" data-orig-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1503,1920\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled\" data-image-description=\"\" data-medium-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-235x300.jpg\" data-large-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-802x1024.jpg\" src=\"http://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-802x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-29731\" srcset=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-802x1024.jpg 802w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-235x300.jpg 235w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-768x981.jpg 768w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-1202x1536.jpg 1202w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled-600x766.jpg 600w, https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2024-canceled.jpg 1503w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 802px) 100vw, 802px\" /></figure>\n"
