    "content": {
     "rendered": "\n<p>Round 2 of The South <a href=\"http://freestonemx.com/racing/events-2/texas-night-series/\">Texas Night Series</a> at <a href=\"http://www.threepalmsesp.com/\">3 Palms</a> rain date make up will be May 25th. Texas weather hasn&#8217;t been cooperating all across the state. We are looking forward to getting the series rolling in the south!</p>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"http://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2019-5-13.jpg\"><img data-attachment-id=\"14942\" data-permalink=\"https://freestonemx.com/racing/events-2/texas-night-series/attachment/flyer-tns-2019-5-13/\" data-orig-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2019-5-13-scaled.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2003,2560\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Flyer-TNS-2019-5-13\" data-image-description=\"\" data-medium-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2019-5-13-235x300.jpg\" data-large-file=\"https://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2019-5-13-801x1024.jpg\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-14942 size-full\" src=\"http://freestonemx.com/wp-content/uploads/Flyer-TNS-2019-5-13.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2700\" height=\"3450\" /></a></p>"
